;    1: TDecorate(count=722, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=2685, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=43, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=32, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=9, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=60, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ごうおん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=972, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=39, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=20, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=5601, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5129, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱横顔血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"It's finally high enough to stand up in..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Taking the mummy's place, we crawled into the hole.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At first the passage was so narrow a grown man could only have gotten through on his belly, but it widened little by little, and after some 10 meters it was finally high enough for me to stretch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was wide enough, too, for the two of us to walk side by side.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, do you know where the hot spring on Mount Itohime is?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"More or less..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">More or less, she says...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If they call it 'a volcano of sulfur,' I expect the summit of Mount Itohime is quite high up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, the way through this cave should be quite steep, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm worried whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, her strength drained, can make it the rest of the way.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, aren't you tired? We don't even know what's up ahead..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"This much is fine. It's nothing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I got lots of sweets just now, and I haven't moved today as much as everyone thinks."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Kidnapped, escaped on her own, and unconscious until just now: that's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Honestly, I can't quite believe she's fine.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">My phone still has plenty of charge, but the battery won't last long enough to run the light for hours.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If the battery dies in this darkness, we're sure to be lost in here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The path has been twisting and winding for a while now, and I can't even tell which way I'm facing at this point.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I can't even tell whether it forks or just bends.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">They say if you walk with one hand on the wall you're sure to reach the exit, but that's a lie.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not every wall connects to the outer edge of the maze.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not that I'd want to test anything so uncertain in a place like this.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, shouldn't we have brought something for light?
{PAUSE ""}
　With only a phone―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's fine. Even in the dark, I can see."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Really?
{PAUSE ""}
　Then... 
{PAUSE ""}
But still, isn't that dangerous―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">, there's no time. So we just need to get there before the battery dies."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seems strangely rushed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s movements have grown more active, and I understand there's no time to take it easy, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Either way, nothing can start until we bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And in the first place, even if we do bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are we supposed to do?</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, how can <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan's</STYLE> power stand against <STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
　Do you know anything?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said nothing in reply.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has no idea either, does she?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血普通.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"From here on, the slope gets steep."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So in the end, the point of bringing </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is still a mystery...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Give me the light?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I handed my phone, light on, to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">At that, the way ahead lit up bright and clear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It seemed to have turned into a straight tunnel.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is the slope about 10 degrees? It's quite a steep path.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Suppose this slope continues, and we arrive in 1 hour where it normally takes 2...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That works out to arriving 340 meters higher than here.</STYLE><PG>
"Um, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, let's go back after all. The path ahead is going to be a lot steeper, I expect. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your</STYLE> strength worries me, and so does the phone battery..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hadn't tried to say a word for a while.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Eyes fixed far ahead, she climbed the slope in silence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She looks to be pushing herself way too hard, so I'd better stop her after all.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>! Please wait!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―I gave her sleeve a hard tug.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血普通.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血アップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't get in my way!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Brutal.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Only with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> roar did I finally grasp how long this tunnel was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A tunnel longer than I'd imagined―an endless road that would not allow even </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> shout to echo.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This endless road, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> roar, froze my whole body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What... what is going on?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is... wrong...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"If you get in my way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you die?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You can choose, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Die here... or come with me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Not that I intend to give the phone back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ch-<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Without the light, there's no getting back to the entrance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's happened to you...?</STYLE><PG>
"No! Let's go back! It's too dangerous like this!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's dangerous about it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Because <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> strength won't hold out like this!
{PAUSE ""}
　Can't you see for <STYLE ID="1">yourself</STYLE> that you're too worn down even to judge that!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm sane. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―I'm going to see her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―what does she mean!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Could she mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, don't tell me you're already dead and..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahahahaha! Wrong! I'm still alive!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There is a way to become </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s servant without becoming a corpse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It is to become the first or second generation, and then the fourth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So it's true, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has been parasitized...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Earlier, when we came face to face with the corpses in the forest, we headed for the abandoned hut.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But meanwhile, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was overpowered by the corpses and carried down here underground.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then she was injected with falsificaso to cure her green eyes, and after that, with Droga as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> in front of me now is first generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And that first-generation </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went wrong when she touched that mummy just now.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">That sound, ringing out without warning―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not far off―it's sounding right nearby.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> so loud it feels like it will shatter not just my eardrums but my bones.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If this sound is ringing right nearby, then―no!</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"So you finally noticed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From behind, a human voice―one I'd heard somewhere before...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hahaha! Ah, I see―this is the first time </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="7">'ve seen me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No way... It can't be! It's impossible!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is this man really...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Nice to meet you. I'm Eiichiro Niimura, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> father. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">You really are always so good to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, what will you do? Come with us?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Or... die here?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Now, now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, no need to scare her so much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Let's see―everyone calls you </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, is that right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, come along with us too. Everyone will be coming eventually anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"N-no...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">With </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> blocking the way ahead and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> behind, all I could do was put my back to the tunnel wall.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I know there's no way out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But just meekly going on ahead from here is dangerous too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Die here, or obey the two of them and go on ahead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Those are the only two choices left to me now―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No! Don't give up! Times like this are exactly when you use your head!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Think! Think...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">How do I get out of this corner!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">How do I escape safely!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">How...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, there's no point agonizing over it so much, you know? </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="7"> of all people can see that much, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What will it be? It makes no difference at all if one little </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1"> dies here, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I... 
{PAUSE ""}
I under... stand..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There's nothing for it but to do as I'm told.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I tried to step forward, but my legs froze in fear and wouldn't move.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My legs refusing to move was a first for me, and it only made me panic all the more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And then the strength went out of my legs completely, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">and I sank to the ground.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Pathetic, for a </STYLE>genius girl<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> threatened her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So it's my fault?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Well, leave it to me. I'm more used to this sort of thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> crouched and met my eyes.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> face once more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is, it seems, a dead man.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">12 years ago he fell from the cherry tree in Central Park and died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Many people witnessed it; </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">his</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> death should be an undeniable fact.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Yet the one before me now is a man who looks like nothing but a living human being.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spitting image.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> are twin brothers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's it! Isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">this man</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's far more realistic than a walking corpse!</STYLE><PG>
"Um... <STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE>'re... <STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, aren't you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If this is right, the mastermind is </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> pretending to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is quite a stretch.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm... If I brought </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> here you'd be convinced, I suppose, but I don't know where he is right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, why not stab your arm with the knife?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... that would frighten </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She's already scared, though?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No helping it, then..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> held out a knife to the man who seemed to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">he</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> rolled up his sleeve and made a cut just deep enough for a little blood to seep out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎手傷2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"All right, watch closely."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At that, the earth at </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> feet began to heave and squirm.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n8000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">From it, slowly, a small tree grew.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Smooth and natural, like a magician pulling a string of flags from his sleeve―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and utterly unnatural in its movement.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, you looked into the apocalyptic sound, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　That's the sound made when the hyphae dig a tunnel, the ground above cracks, and air moves in and out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Hyphae, I say, but not thread-thin things: at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s size, there are hyphae as much as 5 meters across. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">What's growing out of the ground here is one of the small ones."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎手傷1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had said that much when the thing that seemed to be a hypha wound around the cut arm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just as I thought it had wrapped the wound to hide it, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎手傷3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">the hypha slipped back into the hole.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\死月妖花へ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Does that make it clear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Too irregular a showing to be called a magic trick―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a performance that gave away the trick and the gimmick as it went.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wound had vanished, as if time had been turned back.</STYLE><PG>
"B-but... that still doesn't prove you're <STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
It only means your wound healed―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, does it really matter either way?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Whether I'm Eiichiro or </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="7"> have to come with us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">At the very least, just as </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="7"> imagined, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is a huge fungus that keeps growing by parasitizing―you understood that, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1"> gets gentle treatment from you, doesn't she? I got such rough treatment..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ahaha, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">. Back then I had to steer </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, so it was a necessary evil. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">And if we're talking about that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> did some awful things to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> yourself, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"True enough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There seems to have been a great deal of back-and-forth where I couldn't see.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―what on earth happened to her...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I just don't like violence, you see. I'd like to carry this out as peacefully as we can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Dawdle too long and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will come, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm, that's true too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> green-eyed power was needed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is what these two are saying connected to that...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, there's only one thing I can do: buy time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Reach the summit, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s main body sits enthroned there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―what about her works against </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I don't know, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> should be on her way to call everyone right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If we can join up with everyone, then maybe...</STYLE><PG>
<TXSPS>"Hic... 
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="12">Waaah...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>I burst out crying as loudly as I can, seizing the moment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's fake crying, but wanting to cry is real.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But this should let me buy time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"H-hey, don't cry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Uncle</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, honestly, soft-hearted even dead."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, shall I carry you on my back, if you like?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If she won't listen, you could just kill her... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
This girl<STYLE ID="1">'s no use for anything, is she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you mustn't say things like that."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> soothes me; </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is irritated.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That mild temper of his, it seems, is just as it was in life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, I'll use it to the fullest.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">"Waaah! I'm scared!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, come on... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Look, once our business is done, I'll send you home safe and sound."</STYLE><PG>
"Don't touch me! You're going to kill me and turn me into a cherry tree!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Now what..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh, she's so irritating. Why not knock her out and carry her?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Like I said, let's avoid rough stuff as much as we can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What! You knocked ME out!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, that's because, unlike </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7">, you're strong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Forget it, I'll do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, I said. </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="7"> is a valuable hostage. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So let's try not to hurt her..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s wish!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Not exactly, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then force is fine, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Just listen to me for once..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At that, the two of them started arguing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Two people parasitized by the same creature falling out is utterly absurd, but it seems I've managed to drag them into my plan.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even if there's nothing for it but to go on ahead, I'll pull them onto my pace, even a little, and buy time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But either way, I'll be taken to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What will be done to me there―I don't even want to imagine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">All I can do is hold these two up like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The rest is up to everyone... Please...!</STYLE>
